# Generated outputs from running these scripts (results/, logs, exported
# figures/manifests) -- everything under figures/ and this file's own
# directory tree is still tracked; this only excludes fresh output a user
# generates by re-running the pipeline against their own data.
results/
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Raw/derived EEG data and demographic spreadsheets are never expected here
# (see the top-level README's "Dataset description" section) but are
# excluded defensively in case a user reruns preprocessing in place.
*.edf
*.xlsx
*.xls
